{
  "key": 54299,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "SunyshoreCityNortheastHouse_Text_TellMeStories",
      "en_US": [
        "Julia: Oh, hello.\n",
        "You’re quite the nifty Trainer.\r",
        "My husband is a Sailor, and he’s off\n",
        "working somewhere far away.\r",
        "I long for the day he comes back\n",
        "to me.\r",
        "All that waiting gets to be very\n",
        "boring every day, though...\r",
        "I know! How about you visit me and\n",
        "tell me stories every so often?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Claudie: Eh, bonjour.\n",
        "Tu es un Dresseur plutôt doué.\r",
        "Mon mari est Marin, et il est parti \n",
        "en mer loin, très loin d’ici.\r",
        "J’attends son retour avec \n",
        "tellement d’impatience...\r",
        "Je m’ennuie énormément, le temps semble\n",
        "passer au ralenti quand il n’est pas là.\r",
        "J’ai une idée! Pourquoi ne viendrais-tu \n",
        "pas me rendre visite de temps en temps?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SunyshoreCityNortheastHouse_Text_PleaseVisitTomorrow",
      "en_US": [
        "Starting tomorrow, please visit and\n",
        "tell me stories about your travels."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Je veux qu’à partir de demain, tu \n",
        "viennes me raconter tes aventures!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SunyshoreCityNortheastHouse_Text_AskMondayStory",
      "en_US": [
        "Julia: Today is Monday!\r",
        "It’s time to get going on a brand-new\n",
        "week.\r",
        "Is there a story that might help\n",
        "me perk up?\r",
        "Maybe a story about getting splashed\n",
        "with water..."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Claudie: Nous sommes lundi!\n",
        "Une nouvelle semaine commence.\r",
        "Tu n’aurais pas une histoire \n",
        "intéressante à me raconter?\r",
        "Comme... une histoire qui \n",
        "se passe dans l’eau."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SunyshoreCityNortheastHouse_Text_TellMondayStory",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 28, 0, 0} splashed with water...\n",
        "...\r",
        "That sounds refreshing!\n",
        "It’s made me feel awake!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 28, 0, 0} s’est retrouvé \n",
        "trempé...\r",
        "Quelle histoire rafraîchissante!\n",
        "Je me sens toute ragaillardie!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SunyshoreCityNortheastHouse_Text_GiveThisToPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "Thank you!\n",
        "Please give this to your Pokémon.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Merci!\n",
        "Tiens, donne ça à ton Pokémon.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SunyshoreCityNortheastHouse_Text_PlayerReceivedRibbon",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0} received\n",
        "the {STRVAR_1 39, 3, 0}.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0} obtient le \n",
        "{STRVAR_1 39, 3, 0}.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SunyshoreCityNortheastHouse_Text_PlayerPutRibbonOnPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0} put\n",
        "the {STRVAR_1 39, 3, 0}\f",
        "on {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0} met le\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 39, 3, 0}\f",
        "sur {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SunyshoreCityNortheastHouse_Text_TellAnotherStoryTomorrow",
      "en_US": [
        "Julia: Please tell me another story\n",
        "tomorrow."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Claudie: S’il te plaît, reviens me voir \n",
        "demain avec une nouvelle histoire!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SunyshoreCityNortheastHouse_Text_GaveRibbonBefore",
      "en_US": [
        "Julia: Hello!\r",
        "Oh, this is the {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0} I gave\n",
        "a Ribbon to before.\r",
        "I’ve got lots of Ribbons--you should\n",
        "bring other Pokémon."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Claudie: Ah, c’est toi!\r",
        "C’est le {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0} qui porte le \n",
        "Ruban que je t’ai donné?\r",
        "J’ai d’autres exemplaires de ce\n",
        "Ruban, tu devrais m’apporter\f",
        "d’autres Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SunyshoreCityNortheastHouse_Text_CouldntThinkUpAnything",
      "en_US": [
        "Julia: Oh...\n",
        "You couldn’t think up anything?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Claudie: Oh... \n",
        "Tu n’as aucune histoire à raconter?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SunyshoreCityNortheastHouse_Text_AskTuesdayStory",
      "en_US": [
        "Julia: Today is Tuesday!\r",
        "The first date I went on with my\n",
        "husband was on Tuesday, too.\r",
        "I remember my heart thumping like\n",
        "I was scared, and I guess I was.\r",
        "Do you know any story that would\n",
        "scare me like that?\r",
        "Like something that jumps out\n",
        "from hiding?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Claudie: Nous sommes mardi!\r",
        "Mon mari et moi, nous nous \n",
        "sommes rencontrés un mardi.\r",
        "Je me souviens, mon cœur battait si \n",
        "fort! J’avais tellement peur...\r",
        "Eh, tu ne connaîtrais pas une histoire\n",
        "qui fait peur? Qui me ferait trembler?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SunyshoreCityNortheastHouse_Text_TellTuesdayStory",
      "en_US": [
        "One mean {STRVAR_1 28, 0, 0} that bursts\n",
        "out from a closet?\f",
        "...\r",
        "Yikes!\n",
        "That would be scary!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Un {STRVAR_1 28, 0, 0} très méchant qui \n",
        "surgit d’un placard?\f",
        "...\r",
        "Brrrrr!\n",
        "Ça, c’est effrayant!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SunyshoreCityNortheastHouse_Text_AskWednesdayStory",
      "en_US": [
        "Julia: Sigh...\n",
        "I gained a little weight...\r",
        "This dress that my husband bought\n",
        "for me is too tight now...\r",
        "This makes me feel sad...\r",
        "Misery does love company.\n",
        "Something that would make me cry?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Claudie: Pffff...\n",
        "J’ai pris du poids...\r",
        "Je ne rentre plus dans ma robe \n",
        "préférée... cadeau de mon mari.\r",
        "Ça me rend très triste...\r",
        "Aurais-tu une histoire à me raconter\n",
        "qui me fasse carrément pleurer?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SunyshoreCityNortheastHouse_Text_TellWednesdayStory",
      "en_US": [
        "A tearful {STRVAR_1 28, 0, 0}...\n",
        "...\r",
        "Sniffle... That is so sad...\n",
        "I feel desolate, even!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Un {STRVAR_1 28, 0, 0} en larmes...\n",
        "...\r",
        "Snif... C’est si triste...\n",
        "C’est... bouleversant!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SunyshoreCityNortheastHouse_Text_AskThursdayStory",
      "en_US": [
        "Julia: It’s Thursday already?\n",
        "I lost track of time!\r",
        "My favorite magazine comes out today.\n",
        "I’d better go buy it quick!\r",
        "Do you know a story about being\n",
        "absentminded?\r",
        "Like getting your shoes backward?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Claudie: Nous sommes déjà jeudi?\n",
        "J’ai perdu la notion du temps!\r",
        "Mon magazine préféré sort aujourd’hui.\n",
        "Je ne veux pas le rater!\r",
        "Tu as déjà vécu ce genre de situation,\n",
        "quand tu es vraiment dans la lune?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SunyshoreCityNortheastHouse_Text_TellThursdayStory",
      "en_US": [
        "The {STRVAR_1 28, 0, 0} had shoes\n",
        "on the wrong feet?\r",
        "...\n",
        "Ahahaha! That is so silly!\r",
        "How is it possible to be that\n",
        "absentminded?\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Le {STRVAR_1 28, 0, 0} avait mis ses \n",
        "chaussures à l’envers?\r",
        "...\n",
        "Ha, ha, ha! Bonjour le ridicule!\r",
        "Comment peut-on être aussi distrait?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SunyshoreCityNortheastHouse_Text_AskFridayStory",
      "en_US": [
        "Julia: Today is Friday!\r",
        "My meager cooking repertoire is\n",
        "about to run out!\r",
        "Do you know a story that would\n",
        "help me get my thoughts in order?\r",
        "Like a story about numbers adding\n",
        "up perfectly?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Claudie: Nous sommes déjà vendredi!\r",
        "J’ai déjà épuisé mes maigres \n",
        "connaissances en matière de cuisine...\r",
        "Tu ne pourrais pas me donner \n",
        "de nouvelles idées culinaires?\r",
        "Tu as dû manger toutes sortes de \n",
        "plats originaux pendant tes aventures."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SunyshoreCityNortheastHouse_Text_TellFridayStory",
      "en_US": [
        "You went {STRVAR_1 28, 0, 0}\n",
        "shopping and paid $777 including tax?\r",
        "That is a nice number to ring up.\n",
        "It just has a good look to it.\r",
        "It’s sure helped me clear my head!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Tu as mangé un plat à base de\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 28, 0, 0}?!\r",
        "...\n",
        "Beurk, je ne pourrais jamais manger ça!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SunyshoreCityNortheastHouse_Text_AskSaturdayStory",
      "en_US": [
        "Julia: Yawn...\n",
        "Today’s Saturday...\f",
        "I’m feeling lazy and sleepy...\r",
        "I wish I had a pillow...\n",
        "But what kind of a pillow?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Claudie: Ouaââââh...\n",
        "On est samedi...\r",
        "Et j’ai une grosse envie \n",
        "de faire la sieste...\r",
        "Ce qu’il me faudrait, c’est un coussin...\n",
        "Mais quel genre de coussin?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SunyshoreCityNortheastHouse_Text_TellSaturdayStory",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 28, 0, 0} snuggle pillow...\n",
        "...\r",
        "It... It surprisingly may give me\n",
        "a good night’s sleep!\r",
        "I wonder if I can buy one somewhere.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Un oreiller {STRVAR_1 28, 0, 0} pour lui \n",
        "faire des câlins?\r",
        "Mais oui, très bonne idée! Rien que d’y \n",
        "penser, j’ai déjà envie de dormir.\r",
        "Je me demande où on peut \n",
        "trouver ce genre d’article...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SunyshoreCityNortheastHouse_Text_AskSundayStory",
      "en_US": [
        "Julia: Oh, hello! You’re on your\n",
        "adventure even though it’s Sunday!\r",
        "When I was younger, I remember that\n",
        "every day was like an adventure.\r",
        "It was always fun. I loved the people\n",
        "around me... I was happy.\r",
        "Oh, but I’m happy now, too.\n",
        "I love my life with my husband.\f",
        "It’s just a different kind of happy.\r",
        "So, what makes you happy?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Claudie: Eh, bonjour! Toujours sur \n",
        "les routes, même le dimanche?\r",
        "Quand j’avais ton âge, j’étais comme \n",
        "toi. Chaque jour était une aventure.\r",
        "Je ne m’ennuyais jamais, et j’étais \n",
        "entourée des gens que j’aimais.\r",
        "Mais ne te méprends pas, je suis \n",
        "heureuse. J’aime la vie que je mène,\f",
        "et j’aime mon mari.\r",
        "C’est juste qu’on ne retrouve \n",
        "jamais ses bonheurs d’enfance...\r",
        "Dis-moi, qu’est-ce qui fait ton bonheur?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SunyshoreCityNortheastHouse_Text_TellSundayStory",
      "en_US": [
        "You love {STRVAR_1 28, 0, 0}?\n",
        "...\r",
        "Ufufu... That says something about\n",
        "you. It puts a smile on my face!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Tu aimes {STRVAR_1 28, 0, 0}?\n",
        "...\r",
        "Ha ha! Voilà qui en dit long sur toi!\r"
      ]
    }
  ]
}